msgstr "兩棲作戰"

msgid "special_style/battlepass_2020_ussr_desc"
msgstr "全季節風格，為您在戰車遠征賽季 3 期間取得之成就所頒發。"

msgid "special_style/battlepass_2020_vietnam"
